<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 13/14.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 13/14.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Wednesday set the following currency fixings for August 14. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   14.08.97	  13.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3394	    6.3150</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1593	    2.1486</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2462	    4.2254</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4357	    3.4524</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4996	    0.4989</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7211	    0.7186</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2699	    0.2684</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8277	    6.8172</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6888	    0.6892</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1436	    1.1442</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
